.TH AVR\-WORKFLOW 1 "" "avr 0.1.2" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-workflow \- List and view workflow definitions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr workflow
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and view workflow definitions.
.PP
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
list
List workflows with aggregate run stats.
.TP
run
Trigger a workflow_dispatch event.
.TP
view
View a workflow with aggregate stats and per-job breakdown.
